ermine how we and our partners use cookies and similar technologies. You can switch the toggles on or off to set your preferences. You may exercise your right to consent (or, where applicable, object to processing based on a legitimate interest) for the Purposes and Features listed in the tabs below.",description:"Additional header message displayed in TCF modal"},modalTitleContent3:{defaultMessage:"You may also review our partners on the Vendors tab and make granular choices for those who participate in the Transparency and Consent Framework.",description:"Additional header message displayed in the TCF modal"},modalTitleContent4V1:{defaultMessage:"The choices you make here are saved in local storage entries called tcmMPConsent and tcmTcfMP for websites as well as Transcend_Consent_Data and IABTCF_TCString for mobile apps. They may also be stored in a cookie called tcm:{partition}. This information is stored in these locations for a maximum duration of 12 months.",description:"Additional message displayed in modal header. Describes the storage of consent if partition is enabled"},modalTitleContent4V2:{defaultMessage:"The choices you make here are saved in local storage entries called tcmConsent and tcmTcf for websites as well as Transcend_Consent_Data and IABTCF_TCString for mobile apps. They may also be stored in a cookie called tcm. This information is stored in these locations for a maximum duration of 12 months.",description:"Additional message displayed in modal header. Describes the storage of consent if partition is disabled"},modalFirstLayerContent1:{defaultMessage:"We and our third-party partners use cookies or similar technologies to store and/or access information on your devices in order to process personal data such as device identifiers and browsing data. (View our {vendorCount} partners.) This enables us to serve relevant content and advertising to you, and to improve the service that we provide.",description:"First paragraph in the first layer of the TCF modal"},modalFirstLayerContent1V2:{defaultMessage:"We and our third-party partners use cookies or similar technologies to store and/or access information on your devices in order to process personal data such as device identifiers and browsing data. (View our {vendorCount} partners.) This enables us to serve relevant content and advertising to you, and to improve the service that we provide. You can review our {privacyPolicy} for more information on how we collect and use your data.",description:"First paragraph in the first layer of the TCF modal (Version 2 of modalFirstLayerContent1 with Privacy Policy link)"},modalTitleContent1OptionalText:{defaultMessage:"-",description:'Optional text that you would like to include at the end of the first paragraph on the first layer of the TCF modal. To hide, use "-".'},modalFirstLayerContent2:{defaultMessage:"You have a choice in how your data is used. You may consent to the processing of your data for the purposes listed below. This consent only applies to the scope of our service. You can configure your preferences before consenting, or refuse to consent. If you don\u2019t consent, the content and advertisements you see may be less relevant.",description:'Second paragraph in the first layer of the TCF modal. To hide this paragraph, use "-".'},modalFirstLayerContent3:{defaultMessage:"You can also review where our partners claim a legitimate interest to use your data and, should you wish, object to them doing so here. Your objection will apply to the scope of our service. You can withdraw your consent at any time using the Privacy Choices link found at the bottom of each website page or in our application settings.",description:'Third paragraph in the first layer of the TCF modal. To hide this paragraph, use "-".'},dataProcessingSubtitle:{defaultMessage:"We and our partners use cookies and similar technologies for the following purposes:",description:"The subtitle displayed for stacks/purposes/special features in the firs