 or \u201CLegitimate Interest\u201D above to review the Purposes or Vendors relying on each legal basis. You can then use the toggles below to give or withdraw consent, or object to legitimate interest processing.",description:"Description text for legal basis"},legalBasisInstructions:{defaultMessage:"Processing based on legitimate interest is limited to the scope of our service, and any objection you make will apply to our service. You may also select Accept All or Reject All at the bottom of this window to set your Consent and Legitimate Interest preferences for all Purposes, Features, and Vendors at once.",description:'Instructions for toggling legal basis. This is optional - overwrite with "-" to hide the text.'}}),Ie=at("tcf-ui.src.purposeMessages",{purposeTitle:{defaultMessage:"Purposes",description:"Title of the purpose section in the Purposes Tab"},purposeDescription:{defaultMessage:"Toggle \u201COn\u201D to allow us to use your data for the respective purpose.",description:"Description of the purpose section in the Purposes Tab"},legIntPurposeDescription:{defaultMessage:"Toggle \u201COff\u201D to object to the use of your data for the respective purpose.",description:"Description of the purpose section in the Purposes Tab"},specialPurposeTitle:{defaultMessage:"Special Purposes",description:"Title of the special purpose section in the Purposes Tab"},specialPurposeDescription:{defaultMessage:"We use your data for these purposes so we can deliver our services to you.",description:"Description of the special purpose section in the Purposes Tab"},vendorCountPerPurpose:{defaultMessage:"{vendorCount} Vendors use this purpose. See Vendors tab for details.",description:"Descriptor for number of vendors that collect data for a specified purpose"},descriptionLabel:{defaultMessage:"Description: ",description:"Description of the specified purpose"},illustrationsLabel:{defaultMessage:"For example: ",description:"Label for illustrations for a specified purpose"}}),lt=at("